          "alias": "解救破碎地域",
          "prompt": "1girl,solo,petite,wide image,panorama,fake screenshot,key visual,standing,back to the viewer,standing at the torn edge of an intact fragment of road and looking out across the suspended city,her cape and low ponytail floating upward in zero gravity,\nvery wide shot,from behind,wide-angle lens,the girl is tiny on a road fragment in the lower right of the frame,\nan entire ruined city caught mid-explosion and frozen in time,thousands of building fragments hanging motionless in the air,whole tower blocks split open and drifting apart with their floors still intact,streets torn up and floating as curved ribbons of asphalt,a shattered elevated railway suspended in pieces along its own original curve,cars signage and shrine gates hanging weightless between the fragments,torii,water frozen mid-fall in long unbroken threads,the ground below hollowed into an immense empty crater,moss and vines already grown over the drifting pieces,birds threading between the fragments,dust and debris motionless in the air,ruins,abandoned,overgrown,zero gravity,floating debris,impossible architecture,vast scale,scale contrast,depth layering,atmospheric perspective,\ncinematic composition,negative space around the girl,game ui,heads-up display,user interface,retro jrpg interface,japanese text,text,sharp crisp pixel font,exactly one hud element per screen corner and no duplicated panels,a single quest panel only in the upper left corner reading \"停止した崩壊\" with one objective line beneath it reading \"落ちない街を渡れ\",one thin gauge bar directly under the quest panel labelled \"体力\",one thin gauge bar directly under that labelled \"気配\",a single small readout at the left edge reading \"経過0.0秒\",a single circular compass minimap only in the upper right corner with engraved tick marks cardinal letters and a thin needle over a faint map broken into scattered disconnected pieces,a single tilted enamel street sign floating in mid-air reading \"終町三丁目\",a single subtitle dialogue box along the bottom edge reading \"……まだ、落ちてない\",dialogue box,minimap,health bar,\npale cyan and rust color theme,saturated rust and oxidized copper accents against pale cyan haze,vibrant colors,\nhard sunlight,hard light,sunlight cutting through the gaps between the fragments,god rays,volumetric haze,high contrast lighting,sharp cast shadows across the floating pieces,eerie silent atmosphere,\ntext: 停止した崩壊 ……まだ、落ちてない",
