          "id": "codex-suozhang_nai5-0104",
          "alias": "宇宙裙纱",
          "prompt": "1girl,solo,from behind,body facing away,head turned looking back,looking at viewer,upper body,starry sky background,galaxy,nebula,cosmic,glowing stars,sparkling,celestial,long flowing hair,windblown hair,glowing eyes,tearing the sky,breaking the fourth wall,fabric of space,stardust particles,cosmic energy,backlit silhouette,rim light,dramatic lighting,high contrast,ethereal atmosphere,angelic,divine,surrealism,hyperdetailed,intricate details,depth of field,bokeh stars,light particles,lens flare,cinematic composition,diagonal composition,negative space,dreamy,melancholic,soft glow,iridescent,galaxy in her eyes she stands suspended in a vast sea of stars,her back turned to the viewer as the cosmic tapestry stretches endlessly before her.her head turns slightly over her shoulder,eyes glowing with a quiet intensity that meets the viewer's gaze directly—as if she knows we are watching.she reaches up with one hand and grips a shimmering fold of the galaxy itself,beginning to peel it back like a heavy curtain woven from stardust and scattered nebulae.the fabric of space ripples and folds around her fingers,sending cascades of light particles and tiny glowing stars spilling into the void beneath it.her long hair floats weightlessly around her,each strand catching the silver and violet glow from the torn opening.her dress seems woven from night sky and faint constellations,its hem dissolving into drifting stardust that blends seamlessly into the cosmic expanse.brilliant rim light traces the silhouette of her arm and the curve of her shoulder,while the torn section of the universe reveals a deeper,emptier darkness beyond—creating a dramatic contrast between the bright celestial surface and the dark void it conceals.speckles of light spiral and drift around her like fireflies in a dream,the entire scene bathed in an ethereal,otherworldly glow,女孩站在在星河中,像打破第四面墙一样把背景的星河当作幕布一样扯下一角",
