        {
          "id": "codex-suozhang_nai5-0041",
          "alias": "笔下OC绘制色图阻止",
          "prompt": "整体构图：pov视角俯拍,桌面上的纸张与q版小人,大手正在纸上作画\n角色1：1.3::1girl::,1.2::dark blue small hair bell::,white sailor hat,serafuku,white shirt,dark blue skirt,red bow,1.15::light brown cardigan::,sleeves past fingers,oversized clothes,1.3::chibi::,1.2::minigirl::,blush,embarrassed,teary eyes,open mouth,trembling\n动作：q版小人站在桌面纸张边缘,双手用力抓住pov巨大的右手手指试图阻止其继续画画,身体微微后仰使劲拽着,表情又羞又急\n场景：wooden desk,1.2::paper::,1.15::sketch::,pencil,eraser,draft lines on paper,nsfw sketch of the same character visible on paper,incomplete lineart,pov hands,1.2::size difference::,the chibi girl is tiny compared to the normal-sized hand she is grabbing\n光影：warm indoor lighting,soft shadow on desk surface,slight ambient glow\n第一格文字1类型：1.25::speech bubble::\n第一格文字1归属：1.3::1girl::\n第一格文字1内容：\"不要画我色图.....\"",
